WHAT THIS COVERS
----------------

Everything derived from Wikibooks recipe pages, specifically:

  docs/data/graph.json    recipe titles, ingredient lists, step counts,
                          cuisine/course labels, and the embedding vectors
                          computed from recipe text
  data/recipes.json       parsed recipe records
  data/labels.json        cuisine and course labels from page categories
  data/diet.json          diet classification derived from ingredients

These are adaptations of CC BY-SA content and are therefore also released
under CC BY-SA 4.0.

ATTRIBUTION
-----------

Recipe content from Wikibooks Cookbook contributors, used under CC BY-SA 4.0.
Individual page histories (listing each contributor) are available at
https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Cookbook:Recipes and on each recipe's page.

No changes were made to the recipe text itself. The adaptations consist of
parsing it into structured fields, normalising ingredient names against
Wikibooks' own redirects, deriving cuisine/course/diet labels, and computing
numerical embeddings from the text.

IF YOU REUSE THIS DATA
----------------------

CC BY-SA requires that you credit Wikibooks Cookbook and release your
derivative under the same license. The code is MIT (see LICENSE) and carries
no such requirement, so the two can be reused on different terms.
